<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In 5 Results and Discussion ‣ Think, Verbalize, then Speak: Bridging Complex Thoughts and Comprehensible Speech" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>When should I use <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ReVerT</span> over <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Seq</span>?</span></a></li>
